5.4 Modify, adapt, translate into a derived code form, or create any derivative
     work of the Software.
5.5 Remove, alter, or obscure any copyright, license, attribution, integrity,
     watermark, or protection notice.
5.6 Bypass, disable, defeat, or tamper with any protection measure, integrity
     check, anti-debug, anti-tamper, licensing marker, or self-defence mechanism,
     or cause such a mechanism to trigger, suppress, or behave differently for the
     purpose of analysis.
5.6a Re-distribute, re-package, mirror, fork-and-upload, resell, rent, lease,
     lend, sublicense, or make the Software available to any third party outside
     the Authorized Distribution Channel.
5.7 Claim ownership of the Software, present it as your own, or use the Author's
     names, marks, or branding in a way that implies endorsement.
5.8 Use the Software, its outputs derived from its protected internals, or any
     extracted artifact, to train, fine-tune, evaluate, benchmark adversarially, or
     improve any machine-learning model or dataset.
5.9 Circumvent any restriction by combining the Software with other software unless
     the Author expressly authorizes that combination.
5.10 Use the Software in any way that violates applicable law, including export
      control and sanctions law.

